			</div>
		</section>
		
		<section id="prep" class="py-24 bg-white scroll-mt-20 overflow-hidden border-t border-slate-100">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16">
				<div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative">
					<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-indigo-500 rounded-[3rem] -rotate-6 scale-105 opacity-10"></div>
					
					<img src="/images/prep-course.webp" 
					loading="lazy"
					alt="Instructor teaching student driver" 
					class="relative w-full h-[500px] object-cover rounded-[3rem] shadow-lg z-10"/>
					
					<div class="absolute top-10 -right-4 md:-right-8 bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-4 z-20">
						<div class="bg-emerald-100 p-2 rounded-full text-emerald-600">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
						</div>
						<span class="font-bold text-slate-800">專注 ICBC 考試標準</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				
				<div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
					<p class="text-indigo-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-3">ICBC 路考備考</p>
					<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6 font-outfit uppercase leading-tight">
						掌握核心駕駛技巧
					</h2>
					<p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8">
						我們完全針對 ICBC 考官的評分標準進行教學，確保考試當天從容應對。
					</p>
					
					<ul class="space-y-6">
						<li class="flex items-start gap-4">
							<div class="mt-1 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 p-1.5 rounded-lg">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M2 12h20"/><path d="m12 2 10 10-10 10"/></svg>
							</div>
							<div>
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">完美平行泊車</h3>
								<p class="text-slate-500 mt-1 text-sm">一步步拆解技巧，讓您每次都能輕鬆完美停車。</p>
							</div>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start gap-4">
							<div class="mt-1 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 p-1.5 rounded-lg">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
							</div>
							<div>
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">360° 全方位觀察</h3>
								<p class="text-slate-500 mt-1 text-sm">掌握危險感知能力與全面性的路況意識。</p>
							</div>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start gap-4">
							<div class="mt-1 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 p-1.5 rounded-lg">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
							</div>
							<div>
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">盲點檢查 (Shoulder Checks)</h3>
								<p class="text-slate-500 mt-1 text-sm">安全切換車道不可或缺的盲點管理技巧。</p>
							</div>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start gap-4">
							<div class="mt-1 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 p-1.5 rounded-lg">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 14 4-4"/><path d="M3.34 16a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0"/></svg>
							</div>
							<div>
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">車速控制與限速區</h3>
								<p class="text-slate-500 mt-1 text-sm">零失誤通過複雜的學校與遊樂場限速區域。</p>
							</div>
