					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		
		<section id="expertise" class="py-24 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
				<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-stretch">
					
					<div class="w-full md:w-1/2 bg-slate-50 p-8 md:p-10 rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
						<div class="absolute -left-10 -bottom-10 w-40 h-40 bg-indigo-100 rounded-full opacity-50 blur-3xl"></div>
						<h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 font-outfit uppercase mb-6 relative z-10">掌握列治文 ICBC 考試路線</h2>
						<p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-4 relative z-10">
							在列治文考駕照需要了解當地特定的路況和敏銳的觀察力。ICBC考官經常在繁忙的 <strong>Lansdowne 中心</strong> 附近測試您的觀察力，那裡的行人流量和複雜路口需要高度警覺。我們的培訓確保您為以下情況做好充分準備：
						</p>
						<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-3 text-slate-600 relative z-10 mb-4">
							<li><strong>速度控制：</strong> 我們會帶您反覆練習學校區域和遊樂場，確保您在指定區域本能地將車速調整至 <strong>30 km/h</strong>。</li>
							<li><strong>路口掌握：</strong> 您將學習如何自信地處理<strong>無標誌人行道</strong>，以及 <strong>3號路 (No. 3 Road)</strong> 等高車流量路段附近的複雜路權情境。</li>
							<li><strong>掃視技巧：</strong> 我們強調不斷檢查後視鏡和盲點（Shoulder checks），幫助您在危險發生前及早發現。</li>
						</ul>
						<p class="text-lg text-slate-600 relative z-10 mt-auto">
							通過練習這些特定的場景，您將建立輕鬆通過路考所需的肌肉記憶。
						</p>
					</div>
					
					<div class="w-full md:w-1/2 bg-slate-50 p-8 md:p-10 rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
						<div class="absolute -right-10 -top-10 w-40 h-40 bg-indigo-100 rounded-full opacity-50 blur-3xl"></div>
						<h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 font-outfit uppercase mb-6 relative z-10">完美平行泊車的秘訣</h2>
						<p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed relative z-10">
							平行泊車（Parallel Parking）往往是 ICBC 5/7級路考 中最讓人緊張的環節。我們的溫哥華中文駕駛教練將其拆解為一套萬無一失的「公式化」步驟。我們教您確切的對齊位置、車窗與後視鏡的精確參考點，以及反打方向盤的最佳時機。
							<br><br>
							告別憑感覺停車，您將掌握一套適用於任何車型的可靠公式，確保每次都能輕鬆停在距離路緣 30 公分以內的完美位置。
						</p>
					</div>
					
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		
		<section id="process" class="py-24 bg-slate-900 scroll-mt-20">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
				<div class="text-center mb-20">
					<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-4 font-outfit uppercase">學習流程</h2>
					<p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">簡單四步，助您順利拿牌。</p>
				</div>
				<div class="relative timeline-line">
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 relative z-10">
						<div class="text-center group">
							<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-800 text-indigo-400 border-4 border-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 font-black text-2xl group-hover:bg-indigo-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 z-10 relative shadow-[0_0_0_8px_rgba(15,23,42,1)]">1</div>
							<h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-3 text-xl">技能評估</h3>
							<p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">評估您目前的駕駛水平和習慣。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="text-center group">
							<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-800 text-indigo-400 border-4 border-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 font-black text-2xl group-hover:bg-indigo-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 z-10 relative shadow-[0_0_0_8px_rgba(15,23,42,1)]">2</div>
							<h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-3 text-xl">練習培訓</h3>
							<p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">專注於 ICBC 標準的結構化課程。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="text-center group">
							<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-800 text-indigo-400 border-4 border-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 font-black text-2xl group-hover:bg-indigo-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 z-10 relative shadow-[0_0_0_8px_rgba(15,23,42,1)]">3</div>
							<h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-3 text-xl">模擬路考</h3>
							<p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">在實際考試路線上進行模擬測試。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="text-center group">
							<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-800 text-emerald-400 border-4 border-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 font-black text-2xl group-hover:bg-emerald-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 z-10 relative shadow-[0_0_0_8px_rgba(15,23,42,1)]">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-3 text-xl">考取證照</h3>
							<p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">充滿自信地通過 ICBC 路考並獲得駕照。</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		
